{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14680","headline":"同兖州张秀才过王侍御参谋宅赋十韵 · 戴叔伦","name":"同兖州张秀才过王侍御参谋宅赋十韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十年官不进，歛迹无怨咎。\n漂荡海内游，淹留楚乡久。\n因参戎幕下，寄宅湘川口。\n翦竹开广庭，瞻山敞虚牖。\n闲门早春至，陋巷新晴後。\n覆地落残梅，和风褭轻柳。\n逢迎车马客，邀结风尘友。\n意惬时会文，夜长聊饮酒。\n秉心转孤直，沈照随可否。\n岂学屈大夫，忧慙对渔叟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14680.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14680","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}